# Moddy Arena: the battle arena control panel, used the way a player uses it. He arrives and sees the big board on the
# wall beside the gate: its title and his best at these settings, two selectors with a down and an up button each
# (DIFFICULTY Normal, WAVES 5), under them how many monsters the first wave brings (the difficulty sets it: there is no
# MONSTERS selector), what the settings mean (the boss waves, the hotbar wishes) and the start button on its green
# blocks. He walks up to it and presses each selector (he looks at the button and uses it): the word and the number on
# the board change, each press is said on his action bar with the first wave's monsters, and a press past either end
# says so. WAVES steps 5, 10, 15, 20, Endless and back. On Easy a battle's first wave is 2 husks with 0.6 of their
# health (12); he loses it (out of lives by command). On Hard the first wave is 4 husks with a quarter more health (25):
# Hard brings more monsters than Easy. In that battle the board shows its state and a selector does nothing but say so;
# Hard's waves follow (wave 4's husks come as vindicators, wave 5 is a boss wave with Rumble the Ravager) and it is
# won. After the battle the board keeps his settings.
# A resistance effect keeps him on his feet; the monsters are removed by command (the battle itself is
# 4-battle-won's). That the settings survive a restart is a unit test (the saved record) and a dedicated server's
# restart, since a playtest cannot restart its game (arena/README.md).
# play-timeout: 1200
@intent the control panel on the prep room's wall shows the difficulty and the waves in big words with the first wave's monsters under them, its two selectors change them with feedback, the difficulty decides how many monsters come (Hard more than Easy), and in a battle the board shows its state and the selectors are refused
@world flat seed=1

@step he arrives and sees the board
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@expect chat control panel within 10s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1200 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1200 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy
# the board: black concrete over the window beside and above the gate, blue selector blocks, green start blocks
@assert execute if block -2 67 16 minecraft:black_concrete
@assert execute if block 0 66 16 minecraft:black_concrete
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:oak_fence_gate
@assert execute if block -4 66 16 minecraft:light_blue_concrete
@assert execute if block -1 66 16 minecraft:light_blue_concrete
@assert execute if block -4 65 16 minecraft:light_blue_concrete
@assert execute if block -1 65 16 minecraft:light_blue_concrete
@assert execute if block 3 65 16 minecraft:lime_concrete
@assert execute if block 3 64 16 minecraft:black_concrete
# the lowest row has no selector now: it carries the first wave's monsters
@assert execute if block -4 64 16 minecraft:black_concrete
@assert execute if block -1 64 16 minecraft:black_concrete
@assert execute if block -4 66 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute if block -1 66 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute if block -4 65 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute if block -1 65 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute if block 3 65 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute unless block -4 64 17 minecraft:stone_button
@assert execute unless block -1 64 17 minecraft:stone_button
# its words: fourteen lines, each once, and no MONSTERS
execute store result score #lines arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel]
@assert execute if score #lines arenatest matches 14
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel,nbt={text:{text:"MONSTERS"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_title,nbt={text:{text:"BATTLE ARENA CONTROL PANEL"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_label,nbt={text:{text:"DIFFICULTY"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Normal"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_waves_label,nbt={text:{text:"WAVES"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_waves_value,nbt={text:{text:"5"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_first_wave,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 3 monsters"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_means,nbt={text:{text:"Boss wave: 5\nHotbar wishes: 5 a wave"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_best]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_best,nbt={text:{text:"Press a button to see your best"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_start_label,nbt={text:{text:"START BATTLE"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Ready! Press START."}}]
# the pictures: where he stands when he arrives, facing the arena and the board, empty-handed (the chat faded), and
# 3 blocks from the board, straight on
@key key.hotbar.3
@wait 12s
@shot standing-in-the-room
teleport @s 0.5 64 20 180 -2
@wait 11s
@shot three-blocks-away

@step he walks up to it
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 15t
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-1,y=63,z=17,dx=3,dy=3,dz=2.5]

@step the difficulty goes down to Easy and no further, then up to Extreme and no further, the first wave following it
@aim pos -3.5 66.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Easy. Fewer monsters, and weaker. First wave: 2 monsters. within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Easy"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_first_wave,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 2 monsters"}}]
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Easy is already the easiest within 3s
@aim pos -0.5 66.5 17.1
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Normal. The usual monsters. First wave: 3 monsters. within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Hard. More monsters, and tougher. First wave: 4 monsters. within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_first_wave,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 4 monsters"}}]
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Extreme. The most, and the toughest! First wave: 5 monsters. within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Extreme is already the hardest within 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Extreme"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_first_wave,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 5 monsters"}}]

@step the waves go up 10, 15, 20, Endless and no further, then back down to 5 and no further
@aim pos -0.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Waves: 10. A boss comes every 5th wave. within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_waves_value,nbt={text:{text:"10"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_means,nbt={text:{text:"Boss waves: 5, 10\nHotbar wishes: 5 a wave"}}]
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Waves: 15 within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Waves: 20 within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Waves: Endless. They keep coming until you lose! within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_waves_value,nbt={text:{text:"Endless"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_means,nbt={text:{text:"A boss every 5 waves\nHotbar wishes: 5 a wave"}}]
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Endless is already the most within 3s
@aim pos -3.5 65.5 17.1
@repeat 4
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@expect actionbar Waves: 5. within 3s
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@expect actionbar 5 waves is already the fewest within 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_waves_value,nbt={text:{text:"5"}}]

@step on Easy a battle's first wave is 2 husks with 0.6 of their health; he loses it
@aim pos -3.5 66.5 17.1
@repeat 3
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Easy within 3s
# a step back from the board, so the start button is in front of him
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 12t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
execute store result score #easy arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if score #easy arenatest matches 2
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,type=!minecraft:husk,tag=!moddyarena_champion]
execute store result score #hp arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave,limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #hp arenatest matches 12
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 2 lives left within 10s
@wait 2s
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 1 life left within 10s
@wait 2s
kill @s
@expect chat no lives left within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s

@step on Hard the first wave is 4 husks with a quarter more health: more than Easy's
@wait 1s
teleport @s 0.5 64 18.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos -0.5 66.5 17.1
@repeat 2
@wait 25t
@key key.use
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@expect actionbar Difficulty: Hard within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Hard"}}]
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 12t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
execute store result score #n arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if score #n arenatest matches 4
@assert execute if score #n arenatest > #easy arenatest
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,type=!minecraft:husk,tag=!moddyarena_champion]
execute store result score #hp arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave,limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #hp arenatest matches 25
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Battle on: wave 1 of 5"}}]

@step in the battle a selector does nothing but say so
# the wave took him into the arena; back at the board (by command) he presses a selector
teleport @s 0.5 64 18.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos -0.5 66.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar A battle is on. Change the settings when it is over within 3s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Hard"}}]
# the picture: from where he arrived, in the battle (its boss bar above, the board's state under START BATTLE)
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10s
@expect bossbar Wave 1 of 5 within 2s
@shot during-the-battle

@step Hard's waves: 6 husks, then husks and pillagers, then vindicators where the husks were
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
execute store result score #n arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if score #n arenatest matches 6
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:pillager,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:pillager,tag=moddyarena_wave]
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:vindicator,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:vindicator,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 4 cleared within 10s

@step the last wave is a boss wave: Rumble the Ravager and an escort, and the battle is won
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 20s
@wait 1s
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Rumble the Ravager"]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:ravager,tag=moddyarena_wave,name="Rumble the Ravager"]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"BOSS wave 5 of 5!"}}]
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat You won the battle within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 15s

@step after the battle the board keeps his settings and is ready again
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_state,nbt={text:{text:"Ready! Press START."}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_difficulty_value,nbt={text:{text:"Hard"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_first_wave,nbt={text:{text:"First wave: 4 monsters"}}]
execute store result score #lines arenatest if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel]
@assert execute if score #lines arenatest matches 14
teleport @s 0.5 64 18.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos -3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar 5 waves is already the fewest within 3s
